<title>POLAND: GRAJEWO TO PAY NO DIVIDEND FOR 1996.</title>
<headline>GRAJEWO TO PAY NO DIVIDEND FOR 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Polish chipboard maker Grajewo SA will vote on May 16 to put all of last year's 16.2-million-zloty net profit into reserve capital, the company said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Shareholders will also vote to raise the nominal value of the firm's shares for it to qualify to transfer to the bourse's main market from the parallel floor in the third quarter.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
